own event on the link between switch s5 port 2 and switch s4 port 1. Since s4 is on the path towards h5 from h1/h2 (via s1, s5, s4 to h5), this broken link explains the connectivity issue.\n\nNext, I will verify s4 port 1 and port 3 (to h4) to confirm their status.",
